Placeholder for port/ shim headers.

With the feature flags used by ../Makefile no out-of-tree header is reached,
so this directory is intentionally empty.  It only becomes necessary if
CONFIG_MTK_WLAN_GEN4M_EMI=y is ever enabled, in which case the EMI MPU calls in
wlan/core/gen4m/os/linux/plat/mt6833/plat_priv.c need
  <soc/mediatek/emi.h>            (mtk_emimpu_* API)
  <linux/soc/mediatek/mtk-pm-qos.h>
to be provided here, or that code to be dropped.
